From 781a54b38d6e902b4d91361ef53d4ebaeef82110 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <hades@libreelec.tv>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: HDR Vivid sent as Dolby Vision, as an option

Add real-time HDR Vivid (CUVA 005.1 / T/UWA 005.1-2024) to Dolby Vision
Profile 8.1 dynamic conversion pipeline for LibreELEC-Hades.

On x86_64 Generic systems, standard HDMI interfaces and PC GPU drivers do
not support native HDR Vivid EMP transmission to consumer displays. This
change enables HDR Vivid HEVC streams to be dynamically parsed and
promoted to Dolby Vision Profile 8.1, generating standard Level 1 (min,
max, avg PQ) and Level 6 mastering metadata from HDR Vivid MaxRGB
statistics, allowing playback with full dynamic tone mapping on any Dolby
Vision capable display.
---

